"entity": {
"name": "NETSTREIT Corp.",
"description": "NetSTREIT Corp. is an internally managed Real Estate Investment Trust that specializes in acquiring single-tenant net lease retail properties nationwide. It acquires, owns and manages a diversified portfolio of single-tenant, net lease retail commercial real estate. The firm's growth and strategy focus on tenants in industries where a physical location is critical to the generation of sales and profits, with a focus on necessity goods and essential services in the retail sector. Its portfolio consists of properties leased to e-commerce resistant tenants with healthy balance sheets. The company was founded in 2019 and is headquartered in Dallas, TX.",
